Mission Brief &nbsp;

As a Working Student in the Ground Systems Engineering Applications team, y ou will contribute directly to the software systems that support operation, and future development of our launch vehicles. You will collaborate and work in a team of experienced software engineers and aerospace specialists. Moreover, you will have the chance to gain hands-on experience in modern software stacks and how software is developed in the aerospace industry.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;

Your Role in Our Space Mission: &nbsp;

